+ Review surface
```

Filmmaker value:

> Keep an otherwise-good Take, change only a bounded production property, preserve explicitly protected camera/performance/identity/staging properties, and review the result as a new candidate rather than regenerating everything.

This slice is downstream of the observation/preservation contract and does not block the reusable-world spine.

